<div class="puzzle-item">
<img src="images/dory.png" style="float: left;">
<p style="font-size: 24px; display: block; height: 250px; vertical-align: top;">
I was sent with Nemo to deliver corrections to all the broken puzzles. But I had to concentrate so hard to not forget the errata, now I can't find Nemo again!
</p>
