<p class="puzzle-item"><b>Back on the Move</b>
<br>
There's nothing wrong with this puzzle, only nobody has ever heard of the answer.  So we're changing a letter to make it girlier.</p>
<p class="puzzle-item"><b>Bookshelves</b>
<br>
I need HOT stuff!  I want some HOT stuff!  Oh right, the second-to-last clue phrase should be "Highlight of Donna Summers' campground? (5 4)".
</p>
<p class="puzzle-item"><b>Rectangles</b>
<br>
This one's easy to remember.  It's never never the first star!  Fourth to the right, and straight on till morning.
</p>
<p class="puzzle-item"><b>A Short Transmission</b>
<br>
We forgot to include the background rap vocals!  You should definitely intone "What! What!" at the end of the first stanza.</p>
<p class="puzzle-item"><b>p1ctures</b>
<br>
This puzzle is being solved too fast, so we decided to make you go 17 terms further.
</p>
